WEBVTT

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.851
euphoria.

00:10:01.875 --> 00:10:02.976
It was beautiful.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.626
And again, my left hemisphere
comes online and it says,

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:07.276
"Hey! You've got to pay attention.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.698
We've got to get help."

00:10:08.722 --> 00:10:11.577
And I'm thinking, "I've got to get help.
I've got to focus."

00:10:11.601 --> 00:10:14.069
So I get out of the shower
and I mechanically dress

00:10:14.093 --> 00:10:15.900
and I'm walking around my apartment,

00:10:15.924 --> 00:10:19.976
and I'm thinking,
"I've got to get to work. Can I drive?"

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.269
And in that moment,

00:10:21.293 --> 00:10:23.635
my right arm went totally
paralyzed by my side.

00:10:23.659 --> 00:10:27.976
Then I realized, "Oh my gosh!
I'm having a stroke!"

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.619
And the next thing my brain says to me is,